{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"X\",\"regress\":\"有，X在S08、S11、S12等短停留段仍有较多话与感受交替，纵向扫读不如Y左右分栏一眼看到两类信息来得直接。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"X\",\"why\":\"X\",\"whole\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"X用【】直接凸显每段叙事的关键转折，感受又按照音乐时点出现，观众不必同时处理整堆短词，更容易边听边抓住重点。更重要的是，它把离开后的失落、对亲近的怀念、对孤独的恐惧、不愿再次委屈自己，以及最终带着想念继续生活，连成了有因果、有反复、有变化的心理过程。音乐感受也更具体，既有音色、节奏、力度和身体反应，也有细微的情绪转折，Y虽然左右分栏直观，但不少感受仍像并列标签，细腻程度和叙事整合度稍逊。\"} </escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1382e099-83f7-4838-9366-029295914443", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T232533602171Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:26:48.418721+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3f2c9e297070b3128c8fd9d84f3f01549984be10b05ee5d0ca643629e52b7001", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f630